    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d248">

                <pb facs="0386" n="310" sameAs="frus:frus1935v02/pg310"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.20/760: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Dodd</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-03-21T20:00:00+01:00">March 21, 1935—8
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 21—4 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>52. A curt reply announced in communiqué form was given today to the French
                    Ambassador upon presentation of the French protest,<anchor n="54"
                        xml:id="d248-f1"/> to the effect that the foundation for the protest does
                    not correspond with the facts and it must therefore be rejected by German
                    Government. Unilateral abnegation of the treaty chief point in French as well as
                    Italian note<anchor n="55" xml:id="d248-f2"/> and it is understood latter
                    answered similarly.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dodd</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
